  "content": "When our teacher asked us to **collaborate** on the school magazine, I felt nervous at first. My friend Sam was **confident** we could do it well. 'Your writing has good **fluency**,' he said. 'Together we'll find the best **solution** for each page.' We worked after school, sharing ideas. I wrote stories while Sam drew pictures. When we disagreed, we talked until we found a compromise. Seeing our finished magazine made me proud. The teacher praised our teamwork. Now I know that working with others can make difficult tasks easier and more fun.",
